; ==============================================================================
; FILE: projects/apps/raggiesoft-studio-suite/raggiesoft-studio-suite.rsip
; APPLICATION: RaggieSoft Studio Unified Workload Suite (v0.9.0)
; COMPILER: RaggieSoft Installer Studio v0.9.0 (`PackageKind = suite`, `Delivery = web`)
; WEBSITE: https://raggiesoftstudio.com  |  DEV HUB: https://raggiesoft.dev
