Description              = Tree-First Win32 C++20 IDE & CLI for .MSI, .MSP, RaggieScript EXE, Add-Ons & Suites.
Category                 = Packaging
Engine                   = msi
Delivery                 = web
DownloadUrl              = https://assets.raggiesoft.com/desktop-apps/windows/apps/installer-studio/releases/v0.9.0/raggiesoft-installer-studio-v0.9.0-$(ARCH).msi
Sha256X64                = 1c30863c9cb7e3999225f421b13ec1e5c165704539f14ad5755c7f1693d9104b
